      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你刚才趴在桌上睡着了，\n我觉得这样对身体不太好，\n所以就擅自这么做了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3188bb446570870c5650d831ee9a4675e9c820f1bcc64b654e017d8b6e8ee8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
